  "findings": [
    "War-root predicates and remove_participant character target are current exported primitives; no primary predicate alias needed.",
    "save_scope_as is documented for an unbroken event chain; direct actor dispatch retained. Lifetime/reload/MP still need runtime tests.",
    "All ten original option effects are token-identical after slot normalization. Cancel lacks explicit saved-scope cleanup.",
    "The original options do not revalidate membership, side or leadership at execution.",
    "Contract promises are actor-owned variables; native completion/invalidated helpers iterate remaining war participants. Clear only the selected matching promise.",
    "fp2_contract_assistance_failure is a ten-year native failure flag and a -50 native assistance acceptance modifier; its optional use is user-authorized.",
    "Frankokratia start/joins use crusading_claim_cb; native departure removes the actor from frankokratia_leaders, but randomly selects a war. Constrain iteration to the selected war.",
    "stress_impact accepts additive literal trait amounts and does not modify spiritual fulfillment. Both independent optional rules default on by user choice.",
    "Native message_filter_type keys exist for allied, enemy and player participation. Engine notification duplication is not source-proven.",
    "break_alliance delegates native embassy/opinion/blood-brother/betrothal consequences; do not reproduce these callbacks.",
    "No blanket GHW/adventurer-native restrictions are imposed on landed participants. GHW semantics remain an explicit runtime acceptance case."
  ],
